# Population & Sample Data

This folder contains basic concepts and examples of **Population and Sample Data** used in Statistics and Data Analytics.

## Topics Covered

### 1. Population

Population means the **complete group of data** that we want to study.

**Example:**
All students in a college.

### 2. Sample

Sample means a **small part of the population** selected for analysis.It is a subset of population data.

**Example:**
100 students selected from a college.

## Simple Difference

| Population              | Sample                          |
| ----------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| Complete group          | Small part of the group         |
| Usually larger          | Usually smaller                 |
| More difficult to study | Easier to study                 |
| Example: All customers  | Example: 500 selected customers |

## Purpose

The purpose of this folder is to understand the basic concepts of **Population and Sample Data** and their use in **Statistics and Data Analytics**.

